    - rid: 552786097007231813
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328832
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's platforms, which its polygon's permutation is
    - rid: 552786097007231814
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328833
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its kind of platform, which gives it its sounds
    - rid: 552786097007231815
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328834
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Tagged switches and lights change every platform with its tag (0 is untagged)
    - rid: 552786097007231816
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328835
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How fast it moves, in world units per tick (30 a second)
    - rid: 552786097007231817
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328836
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How long it waits at each level, in ticks (30 a second)
    - rid: 552786097007231818
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328837
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Whether its floor rises, its ceiling lowers, or both
    - rid: 552786097007231819
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328838
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It's moving as the level starts
    - rid: 552786097007231820
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328839
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'It starts extended: high for floor platforms, low for ceiling platforms, closed for platforms that go both ways'
    - rid: 552786097007231821
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328840
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Extended, its floor meets its ceiling
    - rid: 552786097007231822
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328841
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its lowest height is worked out from the adjacent polygons as the level loads
    - rid: 552786097007231823
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328842
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How low the moving surface goes (for a platform that goes both ways, the floor's lowest)
    - rid: 552786097007231824
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328843
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its highest height is worked out from the adjacent polygons as the level loads
    - rid: 552786097007231825
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328844
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How high the moving surface goes (for a platform that goes both ways, the ceiling's highest)
    - rid: 552786097007231826
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328845
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its polygon's own heights are used when working out an automatic height (for a platform that goes one way)
    - rid: 552786097007231827
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328846
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The heights its floor moves between, as the level works them out
    - rid: 552786097007231828
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328847
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The heights its ceiling moves between, as the level works them out
    - rid: 552786097007231829
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328848
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Waits for its delay before it starts moving
    - rid: 552786097007231830
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328849
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Contracts at a quarter of its speed
    - rid: 552786097007231831
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328850
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Players can activate it
    - rid: 552786097007231832
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328851
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Monsters can activate it
    - rid: 552786097007231833
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328852
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Switches, tags and other platforms can't deactivate it (it still deactivates itself)
    - rid: 552786097007231834
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328853
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It can only be activated once
    - rid: 552786097007231835
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328854
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The action key opens it. Other platforms activate when they're walked onto.
    - rid: 552786097007231836
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328855
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Players can't open it themselves (a switch or another platform has to)
    - rid: 552786097007231837
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328856
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The map doesn't show it as a platform
    - rid: 552786097007231838
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328857
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It turns back when something is in its way, rather than waiting
    - rid: 552786097007231839
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328858
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Crushes monsters and players in its way
    - rid: 552786097007231840
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328859
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Stops each time it reaches its highest or lowest height
    - rid: 552786097007231841
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328860
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Stops when it gets back to where it started
    - rid: 552786097007231842
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328861
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What it does to the adjacent platforms as it's activated
    - rid: 552786097007231843
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328862
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What it does to the adjacent platforms as it's deactivated
    - rid: 552786097007231844
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328863
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Activates the adjacent platforms each time it reaches its highest or lowest height
    - rid: 552786097007231845
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328864
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Skips the platform that activated this one, when this one changes the adjacent platforms
    - rid: 552786097007231846
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328865
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Activating it activates its polygon's floor and ceiling lights
    - rid: 552786097007231847
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328866
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Deactivating it deactivates its polygon's floor and ceiling lights
    - rid: 552786097007231848
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328867
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: Marathon 1''s flooding platforms (Aleph One reads Marathon 1''s locked platforms as these)'
    - rid: 552786097007231849
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328868
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Whether it's moving in the simulation (which isn't saved)
    - rid: 552786097007231850
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151323390328869
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Simulates something in its way as it extends, which turns back one that reverses when obstructed (it isn't saved)
